    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"Geologic maps, and maps that show areas where undiscovered deposits may exist, are presented for a variety of types of mineral deposits. These are provided in hard copy and are available in digital form (on a CD-ROM of companion report: U.S. Geological Survey Open-File Report 96-683-B) for use in land management by hydrologists, soils scientists, biologists, botanists and other scientists of the Forest Service and other entities.\"",
